eb 2026 county-equivalent by same-state name/GEOID; all have LSADC 06 and their existing state parent agrees. Census counts verify the complete East South Central division has 364 counties/equivalents. #427 owns 244 (Alabama, Mississippi, Tennessee); adjacent #428 owns Kentucky's 120 plus 159 Georgia subjects; the two exact member scopes are disjoint.\n\nBoundary assessment remains explicitly uncertified. EPSG:5070 diagnostics against the 2018 Census cartographic file flagged one county below 0.95 IoU; comparison with current TIGERweb flagged six. These are vintage/representation signals, not proof of a wrong boundary. A focused source-lineage follow-up is #978. Bermuda is justified only as a compact current territory identity; its synthetic parent and boundary remain insufficiently evidenced. I retained official government/status references, found and rejected a misleading ArcGIS candidate whose live extent/license identify Barbados, and did not download restricted geometry. Bermuda tier and reusable boundary follow-up is #979.\n\nAll evidence and per-subject results are being written under the declared owned path. Next: finish reproducibility/scope/hash checks, open one focused PR within budget, obtain distinct exact-head substantive review, and use the serialized merge queue. This work does not certify the wider region or authorize imports.","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChengshuLi/WorldAtlas/issues/comments/5997041577/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/open